    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804470/extras/e3ab2f2f97b61d78554a3ce625ee9390.poster.avif?t=1749123743\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804470/extras/e3ab2f2f97b61d78554a3ce625ee9390.webm?t=1749123743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804470/extras/e3ab2f2f97b61d78554a3ce625ee9390.mp4?t=1749123743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Duel Corp. is a Souls-inspired action RPG with challenging directional combat that you can play either in co-op or alone. Unleash your individuality with an unrestricted class system and venture into a multi-faceted realm with an MMO feel, where a story and procedurally generated trials await you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Character Customization:</strong> Create a complex and unique class from a wide variety of weapons, armor, abilities, and talents tailored to your own play style. A stealthy rogue wielding a great axe and casting fireballs\u2014anything is possible! Plus, personalize your avatar\u2019s appearance to stand out.<br></li><li> <strong>MMO Feel:</strong> Discover a lively MMO-like world in the Hideout, where you can meet and interact with other players.<br></li><li> <strong>Multiplayer:</strong> Effortlessly take part in two-player co-op quests or competitive PvP - let the matchmaking feature seamlessly launch you into the action.<br></li><li> <strong>Direction-based Combat:</strong> Take part in intense, challenging and fluid direction-based combat scenarios. Sense of Learning, Mastering and Accomplishment<br></li><li> <strong>Procedural World:</strong> Explore a varied, interconnected, procedurally generated world full of secrets, unique items, allies and challenges. Find your own way to overcome obstacles by repurposing your learned skills. <br></li><li> <strong>Retro meets modern gaming:</strong> Immerse yourself in a unique pixel-art retro fantasy environment with high-definition 2D textures in modern and never-before-seen graphics full of surprises, twisted monsters and deadly bosses.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804470/extras/e3ab2f2f97b61d78554a3ce625ee9390.poster.avif?t=1749123743\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804470/extras/e3ab2f2f97b61d78554a3ce625ee9390.webm?t=1749123743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804470/extras/e3ab2f2f97b61d78554a3ce625ee9390.mp4?t=1749123743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Duel Corp. is a Souls-inspired action RPG with challenging directional combat that you can play either in co-op or alone. Unleash your individuality with an unrestricted class system and venture into a multi-faceted realm with an MMO feel, where a story and procedurally generated trials await you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Character Customization:</strong> Create a complex and unique class from a wide variety of weapons, armor, abilities, and talents tailored to your own play style. A stealthy rogue wielding a great axe and casting fireballs\u2014anything is possible! Plus, personalize your avatar\u2019s appearance to stand out.<br></li><li> <strong>MMO Feel:</strong> Discover a lively MMO-like world in the Hideout, where you can meet and interact with other players.<br></li><li> <strong>Multiplayer:</strong> Effortlessly take part in two-player co-op quests or competitive PvP - let the matchmaking feature seamlessly launch you into the action.<br></li><li> <strong>Direction-based Combat:</strong> Take part in intense, challenging and fluid direction-based combat scenarios. Sense of Learning, Mastering and Accomplishment<br></li><li> <strong>Procedural World:</strong> Explore a varied, interconnected, procedurally generated world full of secrets, unique items, allies and challenges. Find your own way to overcome obstacles by repurposing your learned skills. <br></li><li> <strong>Retro meets modern gaming:</strong> Immerse yourself in a unique pixel-art retro fantasy environment with high-definition 2D textures in modern and never-before-seen graphics full of surprises, twisted monsters and deadly bosses.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A Souls-inspired action RPG with challenging directional combat that you can play either in co-op or alone. Unleash your individuality with an unrestricted class system and venture into a multi-faceted realm with an MMO feel, where a story and procedurally generated trials await you.",
